1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,345
Why do crackers have holes?

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,492
Holes? Who needs holes!

3
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,079
Uh oh! It's growing!

4
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,900
Steam needs a way out.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:20,990
Holes let the steam escape, so crackers bake flat and crisp.

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,747
Crunchy!
